WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.789 --> 01:42.727
=Episode 9=
(Whether the Moon is Full or Not)

01:48.085 --> 01:49.404
If you have the need,

01:49.404 --> 01:50.485
you can use my computer.

01:51.005 --> 01:51.804
Thank you.

01:52.724 --> 01:53.336
Go ahead.

01:56.885 --> 01:59.731
(How to determine if she is a playgirl?)

02:01.324 --> 02:01.965
Let me do it.

02:16.045 --> 02:17.404
You can still play the violin?

02:19.485 --> 02:20.724
I learned a bit as a child.

02:21.244 --> 02:23.045
My grandfather has a violin too.

02:23.684 --> 02:25.204
He doesn't know how to play it.

02:25.525 --> 02:27.404
When my grandma was sick,

02:27.605 --> 02:28.804
he was playing the violin

02:28.804 --> 02:30.324
for her every day in the yard,

02:30.324 --> 02:32.045
very disturbing, you know?

02:32.445 --> 02:33.844
I couldn't understand

02:33.925 --> 02:34.525
why

02:34.844 --> 02:36.125
he played so badly,

02:36.125 --> 02:37.525
yet my grandma wanted him to play.

02:37.525 --> 02:38.045
Why?

02:39.085 --> 02:40.204
When

02:41.045 --> 02:42.724
we are both old,

02:43.045 --> 02:45.165
if we are still around,

02:45.965 --> 02:46.884
you play a piece for me

02:47.165 --> 02:48.324
and I'll tell you the answer.

02:49.244 --> 02:51.045
I won't play it for you at that time.

02:51.284 --> 02:52.404
Who will you play it for?

02:53.445 --> 02:55.045
Who knows if I'll be single

02:55.045 --> 02:56.005
or have a partner.

02:56.324 --> 02:58.165
If I have a partner,
I'll play it for her.

02:59.005 --> 03:01.284
If I don't,
I'll play it for someone else's partner.

03:03.445 --> 03:04.364
I'm moving to right.

03:04.485 --> 03:06.844
Press this button.

03:07.085 --> 03:07.764
Yes, and then...

03:12.284 --> 03:13.645
Why can't I do anything right?

03:13.884 --> 03:15.085
Even in a game, I'm so bad.

03:15.804 --> 03:16.925
Because you surnamed Cai.

03:17.165 --> 03:17.965
Let me do it.

03:22.884 --> 03:24.724
I'm just kidding. I didn't mean it.

03:24.724 --> 03:25.884
Don't take it to heart.

03:26.485 --> 03:27.565
Actually, you...

03:27.724 --> 03:28.884
I'm pretty bad.

03:30.724 --> 03:32.605
That day, Zhai Xiao said

03:32.605 --> 03:33.764
I just idle my days away

03:34.244 --> 03:35.445
with no goals or plans.

03:36.525 --> 03:38.085
I don't dare to estimate my scores.

03:38.645 --> 03:39.445
Yeah.

03:40.165 --> 03:41.324
I'm pretty bad.

03:42.244 --> 03:44.404
You all
can go to the universities you want.

03:44.884 --> 03:45.684
But what about me?

03:50.085 --> 03:52.404
If you don't do well, just try again.

03:53.085 --> 03:54.565
Some people didn't perform well.

03:54.844 --> 03:56.085
Another year might be okay.

03:57.005 --> 03:58.724
I'm just not cut out for studying.

03:59.244 --> 04:01.085
One more year won't make a difference.

04:01.565 --> 04:03.925
Unless I could defy fate.

04:08.856 --> 04:10.296
Aren't you envious I got admitted to

04:10.354 --> 04:11.965
a first-tier university
with a score just over 400?

04:11.965 --> 04:13.284
Why not try an art examination?

04:13.884 --> 04:14.884
Art examination?

04:15.085 --> 04:15.724
Me?

04:16.764 --> 04:19.684
I can't draw, and I'm tone-deaf.

04:19.684 --> 04:20.684
I'm not coordinated.

04:21.764 --> 04:24.165
At most,
I've hosted a school celebration.

04:24.525 --> 04:25.525
I can't do anything else.

04:25.976 --> 04:27.064
How do I qualify for that?

04:29.445 --> 04:30.404
Honestly,

04:31.324 --> 04:33.844
I think your eloquence is good.

04:34.485 --> 04:36.005
Especially when you're arguing,

04:36.605 --> 04:38.684
you have clear thinking and articulate.

04:39.364 --> 04:40.925
You can study broadcasting.

04:40.925 --> 04:41.724
Give it a try.

04:43.125 --> 04:44.684
Are you praising me or insulting me?

04:44.684 --> 04:45.764
Really.

04:46.204 --> 04:48.324
Being idle in the summer is still idle.

04:48.764 --> 04:50.804
Why not enroll in a tutoring class
and try?

04:51.364 --> 04:53.045
What if you find the right approach?

04:59.808 --> 05:00.804
(What's the difference between
civil engineering and architecture)

05:00.804 --> 05:02.764
How about landscape and garden design?

05:04.125 --> 05:06.605
I wanted to study this
and architectural engineering.

05:07.565 --> 05:08.884
I think garden design

05:08.884 --> 05:09.844
should be interesting.

05:10.565 --> 05:11.565
Since childhood,

05:11.684 --> 05:12.724
I want to buy a big villa

05:12.724 --> 05:13.724
with a garden.

05:13.724 --> 05:15.005
Then I'll design it myself.

05:16.005 --> 05:16.724
Have you decided?

05:18.364 --> 05:19.804
Since it's a major I like,

05:19.965 --> 05:21.364
I should definitely go for it.

05:21.684 --> 05:23.324
And I'm confident I can get accepted.

05:26.525 --> 05:27.445
This is truly you.

05:34.645 --> 05:35.364
For you.

05:41.301 --> 05:43.850
(The Complete Works of Le Corbusier)

05:47.364 --> 05:48.485
The complete collection.

05:53.684 --> 05:55.005
When learning architecture,

05:55.005 --> 05:56.485
you can use these drafting tools.

05:59.724 --> 06:00.284
Thank you.

06:00.724 --> 06:01.324
What about you?

06:04.404 --> 06:05.445
Can I not go abroad?

06:06.872 --> 06:08.152
I could skip Hua University,

06:09.364 --> 06:10.724
and attend any local university.

06:11.364 --> 06:12.525
An unpopular major is fine.

06:13.284 --> 06:15.045
If you're worried,

06:15.884 --> 06:17.125
I can sign a guarantee.

06:17.764 --> 06:19.965
I promise not to take anything
from Chen Jishen.

06:20.925 --> 06:22.364
As long as I can stay in country.

06:22.764 --> 06:24.244
What nonsense are you talking about?

06:25.645 --> 06:27.085
Even if your dad changes his mind,

06:27.085 --> 06:28.364
I still don't agree.

06:29.645 --> 06:30.364
I'm going abroad.

06:31.884 --> 06:33.724
The admission score line
hasn't come out yet.

06:34.364 --> 06:35.645
With your grades,

06:35.645 --> 06:37.085
you can get into a top university.

06:37.645 --> 06:39.565
Are you not considering studying
in the country?

06:40.684 --> 06:41.804
Everything is arranged.

06:45.404 --> 06:46.284
What a pity.

06:47.204 --> 06:49.724
I was thinking about studying
in the same city.

06:50.244 --> 06:51.085
In that case,

06:51.085 --> 06:53.364
if we're free on the weekends,

06:53.364 --> 06:54.844
I could visit your school.

07:00.085 --> 07:01.085
When you go to Beijing,

07:01.244 --> 07:02.485
and make new friends,

07:02.485 --> 07:03.724
you'll soon

07:04.204 --> 07:05.404
forget me.

07:08.965 --> 07:10.324
Who said I was going to Beijing?

07:10.565 --> 07:12.085
I might also go to Shanghai,

07:12.165 --> 07:12.804
or,

07:13.884 --> 07:14.565
Hangzhou.

07:18.005 --> 07:20.485
Fine, I'll forget you anyway.

07:20.684 --> 07:21.464
When results

07:23.576 --> 07:24.165
are out,

07:24.165 --> 07:25.925
I won't reveal my university.

07:26.525 --> 07:28.324
Don't tell me where you'll go.

07:48.525 --> 07:50.165
Why vent your anger with the ball?

07:52.152 --> 07:53.844
Xu Zhi must go to Hua University.

07:54.684 --> 07:56.125
Maybe she'll stay in Beijing.

08:00.005 --> 08:01.005
Please watch her for me.

08:02.244 --> 08:03.404
Watch her,

08:03.724 --> 08:05.284
and see if she has a boyfriend?

08:05.965 --> 08:07.565
I can't control that.

08:07.684 --> 08:09.204
Girls, you know, fall in love.

08:09.204 --> 08:10.005
Who can control it?

08:11.125 --> 08:12.445
It doesn't matter.

08:13.724 --> 08:14.965
Just don't let her get bullied.

08:16.805 --> 08:18.324
She can date anyone she wants?

08:19.085 --> 08:21.005
Okay, I'll send it to you then.

08:21.165 --> 08:22.045
They are holding hands

08:22.045 --> 08:24.444
and sweetly kissing by the sea.

08:24.885 --> 08:26.524
Fine, send it if you want to die.

08:32.644 --> 08:34.765
Why did you suddenly want

08:34.765 --> 08:35.765
to go shopping today?

08:36.005 --> 08:37.885
The TV station
will do an interview special,

08:38.284 --> 08:40.005
interviewing the top thirty in the exam.

08:40.484 --> 08:42.204
Xu asks me to buy new clothes.

08:42.404 --> 08:44.204
When the interview is out,

08:44.324 --> 08:46.524
won't it be played on loop
in the entire hospital?

08:48.005 --> 08:49.244
I'll go buy a drink first.

08:49.324 --> 08:50.005
I'll wait here.

08:50.005 --> 08:50.520
Okay.

08:53.685 --> 08:55.324
Welcome,
please feel free to look around.

09:18.364 --> 09:19.125
Hello.

09:19.965 --> 09:20.845
Hello.

09:20.845 --> 09:22.404
Can you help me pack and send this?

09:23.045 --> 09:24.085
Out of city?

09:24.085 --> 09:24.644
In the city.

09:25.005 --> 09:25.925
No problem.

09:26.005 --> 09:27.484
But we have to

09:27.644 --> 09:28.484
send it tomorrow.

09:28.805 --> 09:29.404
Alright.

09:29.845 --> 09:31.284
Please pay over here first.

09:31.404 --> 09:32.085
Okay.

09:34.168 --> 09:34.765
How much?

09:34.765 --> 09:35.685
238.

09:38.604 --> 09:39.284
I'll wrap it up.

09:39.765 --> 09:40.280
All done.

09:44.484 --> 09:45.324
Xu Zhi.

09:58.045 --> 09:59.885
You're pretending
not to know me so soon.

10:00.364 --> 10:02.444
No, I just didn't recognize you
immediately.

10:04.805 --> 10:06.564
In a couple of days, I'll take you know

10:06.564 --> 10:07.765
art training institutions.

10:07.765 --> 10:08.925
So you have an idea.

10:09.324 --> 10:11.125
If you get in the future,

10:11.284 --> 10:12.444
treat me to a big meal.

10:12.524 --> 10:13.204
Did you hear me?

10:26.805 --> 10:28.885
Let me tell you some gossip.

10:35.324 --> 10:35.925
What's up?

10:37.725 --> 10:38.965
This soda is so good.

10:38.965 --> 10:39.685
Do you want it?

10:39.685 --> 10:40.204
Right there.

10:49.444 --> 10:50.644
What's going on?

11:01.085 --> 11:02.404
I've explained it to my parents.

11:02.965 --> 11:04.765
That I messed up the exam

11:05.404 --> 11:06.484
has nothing to do with you.

11:07.364 --> 11:08.685
They won't give you trouble.

11:11.885 --> 11:12.845
Congratulations!

11:13.165 --> 11:14.005
You did so well.

11:14.765 --> 11:17.364
Even if I hadn't underperformed,

11:18.085 --> 11:19.524
I still wouldn't match your score.

11:22.444 --> 11:23.725
What do you plan to do?

11:24.165 --> 11:25.885
Are you planning to try again next year?

11:28.805 --> 11:29.765
Do you feel like

11:30.444 --> 11:31.484
I'm overestimating myself?

11:34.125 --> 11:36.845
Tan Xu, with your abilities,

11:37.204 --> 11:38.524
if you adjust your mindset,

11:38.604 --> 11:39.564
you can make it.

11:46.484 --> 11:47.885
(What's going on?)

12:05.125 --> 12:07.925
(Seems like they're discussing
volunteer matters.)

12:09.725 --> 12:10.265
(What?)

12:10.265 --> 12:12.805
(Tan Xu wants to apply to
the same school with her?)

12:14.324 --> 12:15.805
(I didn't hear clearly.)

12:24.644 --> 12:25.564
You just asked

12:25.564 --> 12:27.805
me to keep an eye on Xu Zhi
in Beijing, right?

12:31.204 --> 12:33.885
You just said
she could have any boyfriend she wants,

12:34.005 --> 12:35.484
is it really anyone she wants?

12:37.244 --> 12:38.484
What if it's Tan Xu?

12:38.885 --> 12:40.604
What if he also
gets into Hua University?

12:41.925 --> 12:43.204
Do you think it is a market?

12:43.404 --> 12:44.644
Anyone can get in.

12:46.005 --> 12:48.484
What if Tan Xu knows Xu Zhi
is going to Beijing,

12:48.644 --> 12:50.725
he also applies to a school in Beijing?

12:50.885 --> 12:51.765
What will you do then?

12:52.284 --> 12:53.244
Get to the point.

12:55.564 --> 12:56.564
Here.

12:59.925 --> 13:01.725
If you dare, make this your screensaver.

13:06.685 --> 13:08.165
Okay, send it to me.

13:13.125 --> 13:13.644
Okay.

13:13.644 --> 13:14.524
Send it to you, right?

13:17.524 --> 13:18.712
(You are not Chen Luzhou's friend yet.)
You still...

13:19.644 --> 13:21.404
Lucy, you don't care?

13:21.404 --> 13:22.324
Why delete me?

13:27.646 --> 13:29.658
(Happy Valley)

13:45.845 --> 13:47.125
Luzhou, I want to play that one.

13:47.125 --> 13:47.644
Go ahead.

13:48.845 --> 13:49.464
Go on.

13:50.444 --> 13:51.085
Me?

13:52.244 --> 13:53.016
Afraid of heights.

13:56.404 --> 13:57.484
Coward.

13:57.644 --> 13:58.805
If you don't go up, I'll go.

13:59.284 --> 14:00.165
Go ahead.

14:08.845 --> 14:09.925
I'll wait for you ahead.

14:31.765 --> 14:34.725
We are both old,

14:35.085 --> 14:37.165
if we are still around,

14:37.604 --> 14:39.005
play a tune for me,

14:39.125 --> 14:40.284
and I'll tell you the answer.

15:02.284 --> 15:02.924
(What)

15:02.924 --> 15:05.165
(notebooks are recommended
for college students?)

15:31.045 --> 15:33.404
(Oh, who did you hang out with?)

15:34.765 --> 15:36.165
No wonder he didn't reply to me.

15:36.364 --> 15:37.444
So happy.

15:55.413 --> 15:58.283
(Collected by Chen Luzhou)

16:36.408 --> 16:39.832
♪On a midsummer night♪

16:40.248 --> 16:44.707
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

16:46.488 --> 16:49.208
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

16:49.725 --> 16:52.604
(What notebooks are recommended
for college students?)

16:55.324 --> 16:56.885
(Did you see Xu Zhi's Moments?)

16:57.284 --> 16:58.765
(It can't be you, can it? Liar.)

16:59.288 --> 17:01.644
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

17:01.644 --> 17:02.925
(Zhi: Liar's quotes.)

17:03.484 --> 17:05.965
(Whether the moon is full or not,
it doesn't matter.)

17:06.324 --> 17:07.672
(I will always be by your side.)

17:07.872 --> 17:09.572
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

17:12.280 --> 17:14.424
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

17:14.909 --> 17:17.560
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

17:17.560 --> 17:20.152
♪Falling into your eyes♪

17:20.152 --> 17:22.816
♪Oh, oh, oh♪

17:22.816 --> 17:25.016
♪Billions of raindrops♪

17:25.184 --> 17:27.864
♪Like the universe's response♪

17:27.864 --> 17:30.060
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

17:31.064 --> 17:39.800
♪Ah ah ah♪

17:41.120 --> 17:41.641
Hello?

17:42.004 --> 17:43.085
Who are you calling a liar?

17:43.641 --> 17:44.240
What?

17:45.040 --> 17:45.801
What did you say?

17:46.681 --> 17:47.360
Moments.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.040
I saw it.

17:51.721 --> 17:53.280
I thought you were too busy

17:53.280 --> 17:54.801
to check Moments.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.721
So you saw it a long time ago,

17:57.480 --> 17:59.120
but pretended not to see it, right?

18:00.660 --> 18:02.001
You said the retracted message

18:02.001 --> 18:03.092
had nothing to do with me.

18:03.681 --> 18:04.561
Excellent eyesight.

18:04.561 --> 18:05.881
A message retracted in 2 seconds.

18:06.120 --> 18:07.601
You can remember it word for word.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.480
How come you can't see the key points
in Moments?

18:11.921 --> 18:12.881
I'll take a look.

18:17.934 --> 18:23.103
♪Like a gust of wind
floating across the sky♪

18:24.080 --> 18:25.721
Then you have to practice
the piano well.

18:25.721 --> 18:26.761
And I'll make money.

18:27.001 --> 18:28.320
Maybe when we're old,

18:28.400 --> 18:29.881
I can still give you some coins.

18:30.841 --> 18:31.440
Bye.

18:31.918 --> 18:37.551
♪How many sceneries I passed by♪

18:38.776 --> 18:43.640
♪Waiting for an encounter♪

18:44.558 --> 18:47.662
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

18:47.662 --> 18:51.150
♪The moment I hug you♪

18:51.150 --> 18:59.000
♪Let every part of the story coincide♪

19:05.801 --> 19:08.080
(Tomorrow afternoon,
there's a documentary filming.)

19:08.080 --> 19:08.921
(You should go.)

19:11.040 --> 19:12.120
Can I refuse?

19:22.400 --> 19:23.521
(Pay is 2000.)

19:25.001 --> 19:25.721
(Okay.)

19:38.721 --> 19:40.280
That's my experience sharing.

19:40.400 --> 19:41.200
Thank you, everyone.

19:45.761 --> 19:46.561
How is it?

19:47.320 --> 19:48.360
Let me check.

19:52.200 --> 19:53.681
It feels like

19:54.120 --> 19:56.320
the body is still a bit restricted.

19:56.641 --> 19:57.561
And in the middle,

19:58.320 --> 19:59.400
there was a little slip-up.

20:00.120 --> 20:02.001
I feel that you're not as free-spirited

20:02.001 --> 20:03.440
as when you were young.

20:03.721 --> 20:04.841
When you were young,

20:06.080 --> 20:07.841
"my beauty was on full display,

20:08.200 --> 20:09.801
you all can see."

20:10.320 --> 20:11.681
Xu,

20:11.681 --> 20:12.761
let's leave it at that.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.801
Why get discouraged?

20:16.200 --> 20:17.160
Let me tell you.

20:17.841 --> 20:18.721
One

20:18.721 --> 20:20.961
only cares about his appearance
when he has

20:21.240 --> 20:22.521
something he cares about.

20:23.001 --> 20:25.641
Do you know why you were invincible
when you were young?

20:26.561 --> 20:28.320
Because you were carefree.

20:29.561 --> 20:30.160
No, it won't.

20:30.841 --> 20:32.881
When I was young,
I also cared about you and mom.

20:32.881 --> 20:34.040
And my little goldfish.

20:34.360 --> 20:35.961
How could that be the same?

20:36.320 --> 20:38.240
Our attitude towards
all your performances

20:38.360 --> 20:41.801
are always liking,
caring, and appreciating.

20:42.641 --> 20:44.761
But there's a kind of feeling.

20:44.841 --> 20:46.120
That might be a bit different.

20:46.480 --> 20:47.561
Once you don't do well,

20:47.841 --> 20:50.240
that person might not like you anymore.

20:51.721 --> 20:53.561
I sense there's more
to what you're saying?

20:54.120 --> 20:56.320
I feel like you have something
on your mind?

20:56.881 --> 20:57.601
Tongue twister?

20:57.721 --> 20:58.400
No.

20:59.400 --> 21:00.320
No matter what,

21:00.881 --> 21:02.480
It's actually already very perfect.

21:02.881 --> 21:03.681
You look beautiful

21:04.001 --> 21:05.160
and have good grades.

21:05.480 --> 21:07.160
Just by standing on the stage,

21:07.320 --> 21:08.921
all the lights and cameras

21:09.280 --> 21:10.160
will focus on you.

21:10.881 --> 21:12.001
As long as you

21:12.200 --> 21:13.761
don't pick your nose or make faces,

21:13.761 --> 21:14.601
that's fine.

21:14.601 --> 21:15.681
When did I ever do that?

21:15.801 --> 21:16.601
Yes, you did.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.440
It's in this phone.

21:21.961 --> 21:23.561
When you have a boyfriend in the future,

21:23.841 --> 21:25.761
I must show him this photo.

21:26.080 --> 21:28.761
If he only accepts the glamorous you,

21:29.080 --> 21:30.521
we can't have such a person.

21:30.841 --> 21:34.320
Because feelings eventually
fade to blandness,

21:34.320 --> 21:35.721
returning to mundane daily life.

21:36.360 --> 21:37.521
It's the most important part.

21:37.521 --> 21:38.200
Of course.

21:39.080 --> 21:40.921
If you want to spend a lot of money

21:40.921 --> 21:42.681
to destroy this photo,

21:42.881 --> 21:45.200
we can still discuss it.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.761
Take care.

21:47.961 --> 21:49.160
What do you want to eat?

21:50.120 --> 21:51.480
Eat braised mobile phone.

21:52.120 --> 21:54.240
Braised mobile phone is expensive.

21:58.280 --> 21:59.721
Where are you going?

22:00.561 --> 22:01.280
I'll go to

22:01.400 --> 22:02.320
Hua University.

22:02.921 --> 22:03.921
Where are you going?

22:03.921 --> 22:05.120
Hua University, definitely.

22:05.120 --> 22:07.200
That's right, isn't that just fine?

22:07.480 --> 22:08.360
See you at university.

22:08.360 --> 22:08.948
How about you?

22:10.521 --> 22:11.240
Stanford.

22:12.921 --> 22:14.200
My mom asked me to go.

22:14.200 --> 22:15.040
I have to go.

22:15.040 --> 22:15.881
I have to go.

22:16.120 --> 22:16.961
Alright.

22:17.561 --> 22:18.200
Bro,

22:18.921 --> 22:20.040
stop shaking.

22:20.521 --> 22:21.841
You've shaken my hairpin off.

22:22.561 --> 22:26.480
Uh, sorry about that.

22:26.921 --> 22:27.721
I didn't mean to.

22:28.921 --> 22:30.561
I'm just a bit too nervous.

22:30.921 --> 22:32.160
The recording hasn't started.

22:32.360 --> 22:33.160
Relax.

22:35.440 --> 22:37.521
Hello, Yang Yijing
from Affiliated Middle School.

22:37.921 --> 22:39.200
Xu Zhi, from Ruijun School.

22:40.308 --> 22:41.908
No wonder you're unfamiliar with them.

22:41.908 --> 22:43.220
They are from No. 1 High School.

22:48.681 --> 22:51.120
I've heard he's the top scorer
in our province,

22:51.120 --> 22:51.681
Li Ke.

22:52.080 --> 22:53.320
Including competition points,

22:53.681 --> 22:55.080
he scored over 750 points.

22:56.160 --> 22:56.881
Really?

22:56.884 --> 22:58.160
He's not the most impressive.

22:58.400 --> 22:59.200
There's a genius,

22:59.681 --> 23:00.921
who scored 700 points.

23:01.160 --> 23:02.040
Without extra points?

23:02.548 --> 23:03.601
Without optional subjects,

23:03.601 --> 23:04.561
he scored 700 points.

23:05.721 --> 23:07.360
It's a pity he didn't come today.

23:07.681 --> 23:09.040
He's not on the list.

23:09.521 --> 23:10.480
I wanted to see

23:10.601 --> 23:11.681
what someone who scores

23:11.681 --> 23:12.841
so high looks like.

23:13.240 --> 23:13.801
Also,

23:14.080 --> 23:15.921
our teacher specifically
calculated his score.

23:16.200 --> 23:18.440
Including 60 points
from optional subjects,

23:19.440 --> 23:20.921
he definitely broke 750 points.

23:21.961 --> 23:23.400
That's really impressive.

23:24.120 --> 23:25.561
By the way, later,

23:26.001 --> 23:26.641
after it ends,

23:26.641 --> 23:27.521
let's dine together?

23:29.160 --> 23:29.961
With them?

23:31.240 --> 23:31.761
Well,

23:32.160 --> 23:33.400
we're not familiar with them.

23:33.400 --> 23:34.400
It'll be awkward.

23:34.801 --> 23:36.160
But a girl just now

23:36.160 --> 23:37.280
specially came to inform us

23:37.280 --> 23:38.521
the station is giving out funds

23:38.681 --> 23:40.400
for dining together.

23:40.681 --> 23:41.440
How much?

23:41.561 --> 23:42.240
Three thousand.

23:42.240 --> 23:43.641
We must go.

23:43.641 --> 23:44.601
Not eating is foolish.

23:44.681 --> 23:45.761
Yes.

23:46.561 --> 23:47.761
What to eat with 3000?

23:48.200 --> 23:49.080
Raise hand for hotpot.

23:49.721 --> 23:50.961
Oily.

23:50.961 --> 23:51.480
Grilled meat.

23:53.120 --> 23:53.841
I want seafood.

23:54.040 --> 23:55.348
No, seafood, I disagree.

23:55.348 --> 23:55.881
I'm allergic

23:55.881 --> 23:56.436
to seafood.

23:56.846 --> 23:57.400
(Interview with outstanding graduates)

23:57.400 --> 23:58.400
In the program,

23:58.400 --> 24:00.080
I'd like to ask Li Ke one more question.

24:00.360 --> 24:01.561
With such great results,

24:01.641 --> 24:02.681
do you have suggestions

24:02.681 --> 24:04.200
for the future juniors?

24:04.801 --> 24:05.801
First of all,

24:06.561 --> 24:07.921
you must have

24:07.921 --> 24:09.440
a god-like opponent.

24:09.921 --> 24:11.160
With such an opponent,

24:11.440 --> 24:13.120
you are halfway to success.

24:13.521 --> 24:15.480
Because
this god-like competitor of yours,

24:16.120 --> 24:17.601
can always, in exams,

24:17.761 --> 24:19.200
achieve god-like scores.

24:19.641 --> 24:20.561
In this way,

24:20.761 --> 24:22.400
he will motivate you to move forward.

24:23.881 --> 24:25.521
It's the raw score master I mentioned.

24:25.921 --> 24:28.841
It seems you have a good relationship
with this master.

24:28.841 --> 24:30.480
Yes, we are good friends.

24:30.921 --> 24:32.200
Actually, he's very interesting.

24:32.721 --> 24:33.801
When I was in senior year,

24:34.080 --> 24:35.280
I seldom outperform him.

24:35.360 --> 24:36.721
Once, I outperformed him.

24:36.841 --> 24:38.120
I complained to him,

24:38.120 --> 24:39.440
where he shouldn't be wrong.

24:39.440 --> 24:40.521
If it were another student,

24:42.001 --> 24:43.240
he would complain about me.

24:43.601 --> 24:44.601
But he

24:44.801 --> 24:46.841
would not feel I am showing off to him.

24:47.400 --> 24:49.400
It's the benefit of being friends
with someone

24:49.400 --> 24:50.561
who is strong inside.

24:50.921 --> 24:51.601
Being opponents,

24:51.961 --> 24:53.240
but also friends and mentors.

24:53.641 --> 24:55.400
I learned a lot from him.

24:56.881 --> 24:59.360
But those two often mess around.

24:59.641 --> 25:00.561
Once,

25:00.681 --> 25:02.120
on the night before an exam,

25:02.240 --> 25:03.561
they skipped evening study hall,

25:03.561 --> 25:05.040
and sneaked out to watch a movie.

25:05.400 --> 25:07.961
They ran into our dean and his wife,

25:08.280 --> 25:10.801
celebrating
the tenth wedding anniversary outside.

25:11.480 --> 25:13.480
Mr. Gas Tank is so angry.

25:13.841 --> 25:16.200
Uh, our dean's nickname

25:16.280 --> 25:16.921
is Mr. Gas Tank.

25:16.921 --> 25:17.556
Yeah, yeah.

25:19.521 --> 25:22.400
Later, this master
was particularly calm.

25:22.761 --> 25:24.160
He said to the Mr. Gas Tank.

25:24.841 --> 25:26.040
On your tenth anniversary,

25:26.561 --> 25:28.641
you just take your wife to a movie?

25:29.561 --> 25:30.801
Or should I take

25:30.921 --> 25:32.561
a wedding anniversary photo for you two?

25:32.841 --> 25:34.601
After his wife saw the photo,

25:34.761 --> 25:37.400
she felt it was extremely beautiful.

25:37.761 --> 25:39.280
She's elated,

25:39.841 --> 25:42.521
so she really liked the master a lot.

25:43.040 --> 25:45.080
Then Mr. Gas Tank

25:45.080 --> 25:46.320
didn't blame us,

25:46.320 --> 25:47.721
and even bought

25:47.721 --> 25:48.721
our movie tickets.

25:51.001 --> 25:52.160
Okay, thank you very much

25:52.160 --> 25:54.561
for the wonderful sharing
and valuable suggestions from you.

25:54.681 --> 25:55.921
I hope their experiences

25:56.080 --> 25:57.001
can help those

25:57.001 --> 25:58.400
preparing for College Entrance

25:58.400 --> 25:59.120
Examination.

25:59.120 --> 26:00.280
This master is interesting?

26:00.280 --> 26:01.521
Thanks for coming here.

26:01.521 --> 26:02.841
The way he talks

26:02.841 --> 26:04.521
is quite like a friend of mine.

26:09.001 --> 26:11.561
(Knowledge points for broadcasting and hosting)
How are the materials I prepared for you?

26:12.521 --> 26:13.480
Not bad.

26:13.881 --> 26:16.320
Jiang Cheng invited you
to internet cafe, but you didn't go.

26:16.601 --> 26:18.521
Instead, you're here instructing me.

26:19.040 --> 26:20.040
So nice.

26:20.641 --> 26:22.046
There's a price to pay for success.

26:22.440 --> 26:23.320
Besides,

26:23.721 --> 26:25.440
if you really get into a top university,

26:25.681 --> 26:27.921
you'll have to repay me properly.

26:28.080 --> 26:28.801
Hello.

26:28.801 --> 26:29.320
Cold coffee.

26:29.320 --> 26:30.240
Okay, wait a moment.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.200
Repay you?

26:31.841 --> 26:33.440
No more waits.

26:33.440 --> 26:35.280
I'll properly repay you today.

26:35.801 --> 26:37.240
Puns will get you fined.

26:42.120 --> 26:43.360
Quite a coincidence.

26:45.561 --> 26:47.280
Look who's talking. Cai Yingying.

26:47.604 --> 26:49.044
You've found the next one so early.

26:49.044 --> 26:50.400
How dare you call me a playboy?

26:50.881 --> 26:51.801
Are you insane?

26:55.961 --> 26:56.761
Feeling guilty?

26:57.120 --> 26:57.681
Move aside.

26:59.080 --> 27:00.280
Out of my way! Dog.

27:01.120 --> 27:01.881
A dog?

27:02.561 --> 27:03.921
I think you two are dogs.

27:04.280 --> 27:05.440
You've overthought it.

27:05.761 --> 27:06.641
She doesn't like me.

27:06.961 --> 27:08.240
It's my one-sided crush on her.

27:08.561 --> 27:09.080
What?

27:09.480 --> 27:10.561
Is having a crush illegal?

27:11.921 --> 27:14.480
Or after being the playboy
for so many years,

27:14.480 --> 27:15.796
you take everyone as a playboy?

27:18.320 --> 27:19.681
I heard you like collecting stars.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.040
How about this?

27:21.040 --> 27:22.681
I'll do you a favor.

27:23.001 --> 27:23.521
I'll

27:23.681 --> 27:25.400
pull you into
No.1 High School's big group.

27:25.521 --> 27:26.601
Other girls

27:26.601 --> 27:27.881
named ABB

27:28.040 --> 27:29.681
may have a chance to be with you.

27:30.120 --> 27:30.721
How about it?

27:36.521 --> 27:37.360
Is my coffee ready?

27:37.921 --> 27:38.601
Yes.

27:39.360 --> 27:39.956
Thank you.

27:40.160 --> 27:40.841
You're welcome.

27:42.120 --> 27:43.921
Hope your crush succeeds.

27:45.641 --> 27:46.200
See you.

27:50.080 --> 27:50.681
It's fine.

27:50.881 --> 27:52.440
Ignore him, sit down.

27:54.721 --> 27:56.761
Not bad, Stylish Zhu.

27:57.200 --> 27:58.561
Having a crush on me?

27:58.921 --> 28:00.641
I almost believed it.

28:01.040 --> 28:02.320
Your acting is pretty good.

28:02.801 --> 28:03.961
Of course.

28:04.761 --> 28:05.360
Listen to me.

28:05.480 --> 28:06.681
These actors

28:07.160 --> 28:08.240
must be secretly laughing.

28:08.400 --> 28:11.681
If it weren't
for my heart not being here,

28:11.961 --> 28:13.240
and wanting to be a painter,

28:13.681 --> 28:14.440
all

28:15.001 --> 28:17.521
those Awards

28:17.521 --> 28:18.921
would all be mine.

28:20.320 --> 28:21.120
Truly shameless.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.480
This is the most important.

28:26.480 --> 28:27.440
There you go.

28:27.440 --> 28:29.280
Everyone is waiting for you now.

28:30.280 --> 28:32.160
If he's late,
have him drink three cups, okay?

28:32.160 --> 28:33.480
Yes, he must drink three cups.

28:33.480 --> 28:34.040
Alright.

28:34.440 --> 28:35.280
Let's leave it.

28:35.521 --> 28:36.160
Bye.

28:37.040 --> 28:37.641
How's it going?

28:38.801 --> 28:40.040
No problem.

28:42.001 --> 28:42.961
Great, great.

28:46.200 --> 28:47.280
Sorry about just now.

28:47.480 --> 28:48.360
We're classmates.

28:48.404 --> 28:49.428
The chat was too lively.

28:49.601 --> 28:50.400
During recording,

28:50.400 --> 28:51.601
we may ignore your feelings.

28:51.801 --> 28:52.521
It's okay.

28:52.641 --> 28:53.961
I didn't know what to say

28:53.961 --> 28:54.961
in front of the camera.

28:55.120 --> 28:56.360
Watching you chat was fun.

28:56.601 --> 28:58.200
I thought you

28:58.200 --> 28:59.521
had an intense atmosphere.

28:59.681 --> 29:01.521
But your class has
such a good atmosphere.

29:01.961 --> 29:02.761
Right, Xu Zhi?

29:04.721 --> 29:05.400
By the way,

29:05.480 --> 29:06.440
I just mentioned that

29:06.641 --> 29:07.881
god-like opponent.

29:07.881 --> 29:09.360
He will come over for dinner later.

29:09.601 --> 29:10.360
Do you mind?

29:10.561 --> 29:11.480
Not at all.

29:11.881 --> 29:13.280
I want to meet more talents.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.681
If I minded, would you not let him come?

29:16.040 --> 29:16.641
That won't do.

29:17.400 --> 29:17.961
Without him,

29:17.961 --> 29:19.921
our round would lose its meaning, right?

29:19.921 --> 29:20.564
- Yeah
- Exactly.

29:20.681 --> 29:21.761
Or let's put it this way,

29:22.080 --> 29:23.080
Xu Zhi,

29:23.761 --> 29:25.160
if I'm not mistaken,

29:25.400 --> 29:27.280
you ranked 30th
in the province this time.

29:28.160 --> 29:29.601
If that master I mentioned

29:29.601 --> 29:30.480
didn't miss elective,

29:30.961 --> 29:31.601
tonight,

29:32.120 --> 29:33.440
you wouldn't be here.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.708
And you wouldn't be provincial champ.

29:45.320 --> 29:46.400
Mr. Li, we'll go.

29:49.280 --> 29:50.521
Come on, come on, let's go.

30:10.761 --> 30:11.881
Stop scolding, everyone.

30:11.881 --> 30:13.561
This is my limit.

30:16.801 --> 30:17.881
This place is so good.

30:18.601 --> 30:19.280
Academic elites'

30:19.521 --> 30:20.961
relationships may be more romantic.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.440
Does anyone want some beers?

30:22.881 --> 30:23.440
Here, here.

30:23.601 --> 30:24.160
Coming.

30:24.561 --> 30:25.200
Give me one.

30:25.681 --> 30:26.240
I want one.

30:26.360 --> 30:27.240
Here.

30:27.924 --> 30:28.480
Drink it.

30:28.480 --> 30:29.721
Are you going to drink, Li Ke?

30:31.060 --> 30:31.921
I'll get something.

30:32.280 --> 30:33.440
If you have guts, drink up.

30:33.440 --> 30:35.360
If you drink too much,
no one will carry you.

30:35.521 --> 30:36.160
Really.

30:36.160 --> 30:36.841
No need.

30:40.641 --> 30:41.801
I took a plate for you.

30:41.801 --> 30:42.440
Stop eating.

30:49.304 --> 30:52.600
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

30:55.544 --> 31:00.920
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

31:02.360 --> 31:06.285
♪The world is too quiet♪

31:07.928 --> 31:14.200
♪Amplify every sound♪

31:15.001 --> 31:15.721
Pretty Lu.

31:16.761 --> 31:17.881
Pretty Lu is here.

31:19.280 --> 31:20.320
Bros, drink with him!

31:21.761 --> 31:22.921
Why are you so late?

31:23.360 --> 31:24.200
You're so late.

31:24.961 --> 31:26.801
- Sorry, I'm late.
- Excuse me, more beers here.

31:26.801 --> 31:27.521
Come on.

31:27.761 --> 31:28.561
Three drinks.

31:28.641 --> 31:30.480
Come on.

31:31.120 --> 31:31.841
Sorry, everyone.

31:31.841 --> 31:32.961
I delayed a bit.

31:33.561 --> 31:34.440
Come on, let's drink.

31:35.360 --> 31:36.240
I'm here, come on.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.480
Cheers, cheers.

31:37.761 --> 31:38.561
Happy graduation.

31:39.721 --> 31:40.521
Happy graduation.

31:44.561 --> 31:45.921
Hey, look at each of you.

31:46.120 --> 31:47.721
He drinks a bit and you get mesmerized.

31:47.924 --> 31:49.160
If you're drunk, you're fine.

31:49.160 --> 31:50.160
Of course, I'm okay.

31:50.360 --> 31:51.080
Drink it.

31:51.080 --> 31:51.801
Come on.

31:51.921 --> 31:52.721
Come on, drink it.

31:54.601 --> 31:55.320
Am I handsome?

32:06.360 --> 32:07.881
So which university is good?

32:08.320 --> 32:10.280
Hua University and Jing University
are both fine.

32:11.320 --> 32:14.120
(So cocky.
Hua University and Jing University?)

32:14.801 --> 32:16.601
(Failed and still thinking this?)

32:17.358 --> 32:19.761
(College Entrance Examination Results Inquiry:
Chen Luzhou 713)

32:19.761 --> 32:20.681
713.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.480
Well done.

32:23.040 --> 32:23.641
Not bad, huh?

32:24.480 --> 32:25.200
But for me,

32:25.200 --> 32:26.641
if it's not 750, it's a fail.

32:27.160 --> 32:28.961
You people from No.1 High School
are crazy.

32:34.240 --> 32:37.080
Chen Luzhou, are you messing with me?

32:41.040 --> 32:42.280
What about in Shanghai?

32:43.360 --> 32:44.601
In rainy season,

32:44.721 --> 32:46.480
you hang clothes and they don't dry.

32:46.480 --> 32:48.240
All the sheets are wet.

32:49.080 --> 32:50.721
You'll feel sticky all over every day.

32:50.721 --> 32:51.881
Not comfortable at all.

32:53.921 --> 32:55.921
I still prefer the weather in the north.

32:56.080 --> 32:57.521
It is drier.

32:57.961 --> 32:58.561
Yes.

33:00.320 --> 33:02.040
The south is too humid.

33:02.040 --> 33:03.240
Uncomfortable.

33:03.240 --> 33:04.440
It is like that in the south.

33:08.001 --> 33:09.681
(If you don't come over, I'll go over.)

33:11.761 --> 33:12.961
(I'll count down.)

33:15.200 --> 33:15.801
(10)

33:16.200 --> 33:16.801
(9)

33:17.400 --> 33:18.001
(8)

33:18.641 --> 33:19.240
(7)

33:20.240 --> 33:20.761
(3)

33:21.280 --> 33:21.881
(2)

33:22.320 --> 33:22.921
(1)

33:23.961 --> 33:26.040
What if I'm not used to eating
those things?

33:26.320 --> 33:28.080
You'll get used to it.

33:28.080 --> 33:30.080
(You skipped six, five, four)

33:31.080 --> 33:33.440
(I have been counting
like this since childhood.)

33:33.761 --> 33:34.641
(Are you coming?)

33:39.320 --> 33:40.601
(I wasn't someone)

33:40.601 --> 33:41.721
(who would go over)

33:41.721 --> 33:42.964
(at the mere call of others.)

33:46.240 --> 33:47.200
Here I come.

33:50.320 --> 33:51.601
There's quite a lot to eat.

33:51.601 --> 33:52.601
But no staple food.

33:52.601 --> 33:53.601
It's all desserts.

33:53.841 --> 33:54.921
How can I feel full?

33:55.400 --> 33:56.681
With so many people and 3000.

34:00.240 --> 34:00.921
Pretty Lu.

34:02.881 --> 34:03.521
Pretty Lu.

34:05.001 --> 34:06.120
You might not know.

34:06.961 --> 34:08.280
That one, over there,

34:08.660 --> 34:09.812
isn't from No.1 High School,

34:09.812 --> 34:10.721
but Ruijun School.

34:11.360 --> 34:11.921
She looks

34:11.921 --> 34:13.561
like the girls
in our school's art class.

34:14.120 --> 34:14.921
She's super pretty

34:15.601 --> 34:17.801
with a slim waist and long legs.

34:20.080 --> 34:21.040
You looked at her.

34:21.961 --> 34:22.881
Didn't look closely.

34:23.200 --> 34:24.080
Just glanced twice.

34:26.681 --> 34:28.601
Hey, why did you kick me?

34:29.480 --> 34:30.320
I just saw a mouse

34:30.320 --> 34:31.200
scurried by.

34:31.881 --> 34:33.761
Mouse? Where?

34:34.080 --> 34:34.881
No mouse.

34:35.320 --> 34:35.961
Barbecue there.

34:36.320 --> 34:37.440
Xu Zhi, I'm going there.

34:38.036 --> 34:38.561
Okay.

34:38.561 --> 34:41.080
I brought a Polaroid.
How about we take a picture?

34:42.040 --> 34:43.124
Sure, come on.

34:43.156 --> 34:45.120
Students from No.1 High School,
come take a photo.

34:45.561 --> 34:46.120
Come on.

34:46.120 --> 34:46.881
Take a picture.

34:47.641 --> 34:48.280
Take a picture.

34:48.280 --> 34:48.801
Come on.

34:48.801 --> 34:49.681
Find a better place.

34:49.681 --> 34:50.360
Stop drinking.

34:50.641 --> 34:51.721
Come here, here.

34:52.080 --> 34:52.881
Let's go.

34:53.601 --> 34:54.360
Let's go.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.440
Let's take a picture.

34:55.921 --> 34:57.681
Waiter, help us take a group photo.

34:57.681 --> 34:58.196
Okay.

34:58.801 --> 35:00.001
Pretty Lu, come on.

35:00.001 --> 35:01.801
- Go to center position.
- Center position.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.200
Hurry up, Yu.

35:03.360 --> 35:04.280
Come on, three,

35:04.280 --> 35:05.200
two,

35:05.200 --> 35:05.761
one.

35:07.360 --> 35:08.641
Cheese.

35:08.761 --> 35:09.841
Come on, one more picture?

35:09.841 --> 35:10.440
Another one.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.280
One more.

35:11.280 --> 35:12.601
You guys take the picture first.

35:12.601 --> 35:13.521
Okay, okay.

35:13.681 --> 35:14.601
Okay, okay.

35:16.120 --> 35:16.921
A vertical one.

35:17.360 --> 35:18.681
Take it vertically. Let's smile.

35:18.681 --> 35:19.200
Smile.

35:19.200 --> 35:19.881
Okay, okay.

35:19.881 --> 35:20.440
Come on.

35:21.561 --> 35:22.320
Two, three.

35:22.841 --> 35:23.360
Cheese.

35:23.360 --> 35:25.160
(What are you looking at?
Come over here.)

35:28.440 --> 35:29.681
(Busy admiring young couples.)

35:31.240 --> 35:32.561
(I found the first impression)

35:32.561 --> 35:33.601
(is so important.)

35:34.961 --> 35:36.320
(Since the first time we met,)

35:36.681 --> 35:37.721
(have you engraved)

35:38.601 --> 35:40.001
(what my mom said into your heart?)

35:41.921 --> 35:43.360
(Indeed, it's unforgettable.)

35:44.160 --> 35:45.320
(Covered in romantic debts?)

35:45.681 --> 35:46.961
(Everyone here is my classmate.)

35:47.681 --> 35:49.001
(If you can ask anything,)

35:49.001 --> 35:50.132
(I'll take your last name.)

35:50.480 --> 35:51.440
(So confident.)

35:52.480 --> 35:53.921
(Does it count if others like you?)

35:54.360 --> 35:55.921
(The ones who took photos with you)

35:56.280 --> 35:57.521
(are quite suspicious.)

35:57.961 --> 35:59.120
(Your standards are strict.)

35:59.480 --> 36:01.480
(I can control the fact of being liked?)

36:02.120 --> 36:02.708
(Moreover,)

36:03.120 --> 36:04.961
(can you guarantee
that no one has liked you?)

36:05.160 --> 36:07.561
(No, but I never hide it.)

36:13.080 --> 36:14.160
No more beers, right?

36:14.561 --> 36:15.240
I'll go get some.

36:17.280 --> 36:18.280
Come on, this one.

36:18.961 --> 36:20.080
I'll take it away.

36:20.961 --> 36:21.556
What?

36:22.160 --> 36:23.200
It's not for me to drink,

36:24.160 --> 36:25.601
but the girls have nothing to drink.

36:26.360 --> 36:27.200
That's your problem.

36:27.200 --> 36:27.841
Figure it out.

36:28.200 --> 36:30.320
This is reserved for her.
Don't touch it.

36:34.440 --> 36:35.200
Who?

36:42.120 --> 36:43.561
Are you siding with outsiders?

36:45.601 --> 36:47.841
Fine, fine, I won't compete with you.

36:50.160 --> 36:50.721
Waiter,

36:51.080 --> 36:52.120
get me a bottle of beer.

36:54.480 --> 36:55.320
Is there any beer?

36:56.040 --> 36:56.801
Thank you.

36:57.200 --> 36:57.801
Thank you.

37:04.801 --> 37:06.240
You've been ignoring me.

37:06.601 --> 37:07.841
But my beer attracts you here.

37:08.761 --> 37:10.040
Am I not even worth beer?

37:10.040 --> 37:11.001
Miss Xu?

37:11.521 --> 37:13.160
I went to see if the barbecue is ready.

37:13.801 --> 37:14.721
Why don't you

37:14.721 --> 37:16.040
lock yourself in the chair?

37:16.280 --> 37:17.761
Naked man 713.

37:24.360 --> 37:25.040
Try it.

37:25.040 --> 37:26.200
I just grilled lamb skewers.

37:26.681 --> 37:27.480
They're so tender.

37:28.961 --> 37:29.921
Do you want to try?

37:29.921 --> 37:31.280
I don't eat cumin.

37:31.360 --> 37:33.001
Alrighty, why don't you give it a taste?

37:33.160 --> 37:33.721
Later.

37:33.721 --> 37:34.360
I finish this.

37:34.521 --> 37:36.561
Alright. By the way,

37:36.681 --> 37:37.400
I wonder to know

37:37.961 --> 37:39.480
if many girls are secretly in love

37:39.480 --> 37:40.276
with Chen Luzhou?

37:40.921 --> 37:41.761
Not really.

37:41.921 --> 37:44.001
I think there are more
from other classes.

37:44.200 --> 37:45.120
Once class is over,

37:45.280 --> 37:46.961
our class's corridor
is the most crowded.

37:47.601 --> 37:49.320
They're all to see him.

37:49.801 --> 37:51.001
Is it because he's handsome?

37:51.400 --> 37:53.280
I think it's not entirely because that.

37:53.881 --> 37:55.040
Then why is it?

37:55.040 --> 37:55.961
Because he's excellent.

37:57.080 --> 37:59.761
At first, no one knew he entered
via guaranteed admission.

37:59.761 --> 38:01.721
We just heard his dad is very rich.

38:02.001 --> 38:03.761
Everyone thought he bought his way in.

38:04.200 --> 38:05.040
And then?

38:05.120 --> 38:05.761
Then,

38:05.841 --> 38:07.881
in our class's first midterm exam,

38:08.721 --> 38:10.280
he was the absolute first.

38:10.480 --> 38:13.040
He was nearly twenty points higher
than the second place,

38:13.400 --> 38:14.961
who's Li Ke.

38:15.881 --> 38:17.881
This really excited Ke.

38:18.120 --> 38:18.801
After many years,

38:18.961 --> 38:20.801
he encountered a real opponent.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.601
Chen Luzhou was the first,

38:22.681 --> 38:23.440
and the only one.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.480
I really wonder,

38:26.841 --> 38:28.160
after he goes to university,

38:28.280 --> 38:29.561
what kind of girl he will love.

38:32.280 --> 38:33.360
How would I know!

38:33.801 --> 38:34.841
You go ask him yourself.

38:35.400 --> 38:36.160
Yeah, true.

38:37.160 --> 38:38.036
I'll try another one.

38:38.521 --> 38:39.561
They are all delicious.

38:39.841 --> 38:41.080
I just grilled that myself.

38:41.080 --> 38:42.001
I'll try yours.

38:42.160 --> 38:42.676
Go ahead.

38:45.080 --> 38:46.400
(We'll settle our bill later)

38:46.801 --> 38:47.761
(I'll introduce you.)

38:47.761 --> 38:49.521
(Many people here
will go to Hua University.)

38:49.521 --> 38:50.561
(They'll be your classmates.)

38:50.561 --> 38:53.601
I combined the knowledge,
including physics,

38:53.681 --> 38:54.961
and chemistry to grill this.

38:57.001 --> 38:58.160
Hello.

38:58.440 --> 38:59.561
Hello, hello.

38:59.561 --> 39:00.641
Come on, sit down.

39:01.120 --> 39:01.652
Hello.

39:02.120 --> 39:02.921
I'll do it myself.

39:04.801 --> 39:05.921
Would you like to try some?

39:06.400 --> 39:07.721
Sure, sure.

39:07.721 --> 39:08.761
This smells great.

39:09.200 --> 39:10.240
I'll grill some mushrooms.

39:12.801 --> 39:14.160
I want to eat mushrooms, too.

39:15.801 --> 39:16.681
I'll leave it to you.

39:18.040 --> 39:18.580
Okay.

39:21.681 --> 39:22.676
The mushrooms are good.

39:27.280 --> 39:27.881
Pretty Lu,

39:29.160 --> 39:29.841
you're strange.

39:35.761 --> 39:36.280
What?

39:37.440 --> 39:38.004
Smells good.

39:39.200 --> 39:40.961
Yang Yijing, right?

39:40.961 --> 39:41.480
It's him.

39:42.080 --> 39:43.160
I found on your Moments,

39:43.521 --> 39:44.881
you are interested in

39:44.881 --> 39:45.841
quantum mechanics.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.921
You also love quantum mechanics?

39:48.801 --> 39:49.440
Let's chat.

39:49.921 --> 39:50.580
Sure.

39:50.801 --> 39:51.412
Let's go.

40:26.841 --> 40:28.561
Done, want some?

40:29.160 --> 40:30.120
I don't eat cumin.

40:36.568 --> 40:37.592
Potatoes?

40:39.960 --> 40:41.144
Thank you, Pretty Lu.

40:44.280 --> 40:45.001
Eat slowly.

40:54.881 --> 40:55.841
Why follow me?

40:59.001 --> 40:59.761
Why hide from me?

41:02.561 --> 41:04.001
You stepped on my shadow.

41:06.841 --> 41:08.761
Alright, I'll walk behind.

41:09.961 --> 41:10.601
Step on mine.

41:13.641 --> 41:14.881
What exactly do you want?

41:16.240 --> 41:16.961
At 8.30 PM,

41:17.561 --> 41:18.561
there are fireworks.

41:19.320 --> 41:20.001
See it?

41:21.040 --> 41:22.120
No.

41:25.561 --> 41:27.440
Alright, I'll go see it myself.

41:31.921 --> 41:32.856
Really not going?

41:35.192 --> 41:36.088
Let's go.

41:36.881 --> 41:38.881
You still stepped on mine!
No stepping allowed.

41:42.921 --> 41:43.921
So childish.

41:44.564 --> 41:45.588
Not as childish as you.

41:52.536 --> 41:55.832
♪Even if it rains on you♪

41:56.216 --> 42:00.088
♪I will always be with you♪

42:00.376 --> 42:03.588
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

42:03.864 --> 42:06.424
♪Our love will last♪

42:06.648 --> 42:09.687
♪Even if it rains on you♪

42:09.976 --> 42:12.568
♪I will always be with you♪

42:12.568 --> 42:24.344
(Whether the moon is full or not,
I'll always be there for you.)

42:26.544 --> 42:32.360
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

42:32.912 --> 42:38.440
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

42:39.952 --> 42:44.400
♪The world is too quiet♪

42:45.392 --> 42:52.320
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

42:53.232 --> 42:58.320
♪Who will visit me♪

42:59.376 --> 43:05.000
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

43:05.744 --> 43:08.800
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

43:09.040 --> 43:14.360
♪Into concern and care♪

43:19.888 --> 43:25.000
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

43:25.520 --> 43:31.360
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

43:32.816 --> 43:36.200
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

43:36.336 --> 43:42.560
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

43:43.056 --> 43:46.000
♪The lonely clock♪

43:46.160 --> 43:50.760
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

43:51.152 --> 43:54.400
♪Are we both♪

43:54.672 --> 43:58.200
♪Attracted to each other♪

43:59.344 --> 44:05.960
♪Falling into you♪

44:09.680 --> 44:15.480
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

44:16.336 --> 44:19.000
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

44:19.536 --> 44:24.160
♪From reaching eternity♪

44:24.560 --> 44:27.840
♪After rushing recklessly♪

44:28.048 --> 44:31.480
♪We approach each other♪

44:32.752 --> 44:36.360
♪Without turning back♪

44:37.744 --> 44:45.400
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

44:46.032 --> 44:52.520
♪Falling into you♪
